                                "sense_id": "34f03bc7-f29b-313f-b95a-0e940eacf224",
                                "text": "The bullet struck her in the back and killed her, and to this day I am glad that it did, for, as it afterwards transpired, she had availed herself of the anthropophagous customs of the Amahagger to organise the whole thing in revenge of the slight put upon her by Job."
                            },
