                                "sense_id": "34f03bc7-f29b-313f-b95a-0e940eacf224",
                                "text": "Man-eating lions, tigers, and crocodiles have been extensively treated in historical and fictional literature, and elaborate attempts have been made to halt their anthropophagous habits."
